# Models to pull onto the network volume (scripts/media/models-pull.sh).
# One per line: <huggingface repo id> <tab> <file path inside the repo> <tab> <models/ subfolder>
# Lines starting with # are ignored. The example rows are placeholders -- pick the models you actually
# use and check each model's licence for commercial use yourself (this repository takes no position).
#
# Comfy-Org/flux1-schnell	flux1-schnell-fp8.safetensors	checkpoints
